        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(skill-workshop): add restore action for quarantined proposals and display scan findings",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/106134\r\n\r\nQuarantined skill workshop proposals had no recovery path. The UI only rendered action buttons for pending proposals, so quarantined proposals were effectively stuck. Users had to manually edit `proposal.json` to change the status back to pending. Scan findings existed in the data model but were never surfaced in the UI.\r\n\r\n## What This PR Does\r\n\r\n### Backend\r\n\r\n- Add `restoreSkillProposal()` service function: moves a quarantined proposal back to pending, re-scans content and support files for a fresh security assessment\r\n- Add `skills.proposals.restore` gateway endpoint with proper method registration, core descriptors, and scope authorization\r\n\r\n### Frontend\r\n\r\n- Extend `SkillWorkshopProposal` type with `scan` and `statusReason` fields\r\n- Render scan findings in the proposal detail card: severity badges, file location, rule message, and evidence code snippets\r\n- Add \"Restore\" button in the quarantined proposal action bar\r\n- Style scan section as a white card with severity-colored badges and finding rows\r\n- Show scan findings for pending proposals as well (not just quarantined), so restored proposals with scan issues are visible\r\n- Disable the Apply button with a warning when scan state is not clean, preventing surprise re-quarantine\r\n\r\n### i18n\r\n\r\n- Add `scan` section and `actions.restore` / `actions.restoring` strings for en, zh-CN, zh-TW\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\n<!-- TODO: add screenshots -->\r\n\r\n### Quarantined proposal — scan findings and restore button\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1911\" height=\"959\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e95a631a-798f-4194-a4af-d1aa7f5d32f0\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n### Apply button disabled when scan has issues\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1904\" height=\"923\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f2ffd31-58ae-4e1d-bdb2-4011504bdb0a\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Evidence\r\n\r\n- [x] All workshop service tests pass (including 2 new restore tests)\r\n- [x] Gateway method scope tests pass\r\n- [x] `oxfmt --check` passes\r\n",
